If a virtual-visit is a standard-care in a practice-context and an observational-telehealth-follow-up-assessment is available then every clinician may conduct the observational-telehealth-follow-up-assessment with a patient.
If a patient has an in-person-follow-up-visit-challenge and an observational-telehealth-follow-up-assessment is available then every clinician may conduct the observational-telehealth-follow-up-assessment with the patient.
Every observational-telehealth-follow-up-assessment can enable a clinician-patient-communication and can enable a patient-observation.
